  Ubuntu SSH + Claude Code workstation (Railway)

  * claude .......... Claude Code CLI (try: claude --version)
  * ~/projects ...... your workspace
  * persistence ..... everything under /home (this directory)
                      survives redeploys and restarts
  * auth ............ public key only; passwords are disabled
  * sudo ............ available (this is your single-user box)

  First time here? Run:  claude   and follow the login prompt,
  or set ANTHROPIC_API_KEY as a Railway variable and redeploy.

